<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
<p>By registering for or attending The Schools of India Summit 2027, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not register.</p>
<h2>2. Registration &amp; Ticketing</h2>
<p>The Summit takes place on 10th January 2027 at The Westin, Koregaon Park, Pune. It is a one-day, in-person, non-residential event. Delegate passes cost ₹5,000 + GST. Student passes cost ₹2,000 + GST and are available to students in Grade 10 and above; verification may be required. Groups of five or more delegate passes receive a 10% discount. There is no early-bird price.</p>
<p>Both passes include access to the daytime programme, workshops and networking, morning tea and snacks, lunch and high tea. Evening performances and the gala dinner are included with the Delegate Pass only. Travel and accommodation are not included. Tickets are non-transferable. Refund requests are considered case by case, subject to management approval. The GST invoice process is pending confirmation.</p>
<p>TezTicket is the planned ticketing partner. Payments made through a ticketing provider are also subject to that provider’s applicable terms. Submitting a booking-assistance enquiry on this website does not reserve a ticket or take payment.</p>
<h2>3. Event Changes</h2>
<p>TSOI may modify the programme, speakers, timings or venue where necessary. Registrants will be notified of material changes ahead of the event.</p>
<h2>4. Media &amp; Photography</h2>
<p>By attending, you consent to being photographed and filmed for TSOI’s promotional and archival use, including Summit stage recordings and session photography. Please contact the team with any concerns.</p>
